Usage: semaphore [flags]

Semaphore relay proxy: serves feature flags over OFREP from a version 2
bootstrap file.

Flags:
      --state-dir=DIR        controlPlane.stateDir, empty for no state directory
                             (or SEMAPHORE_STATE_DIR)
      --config=FILE          Location of the version 2 bootstrap file (or
                             SEMAPHORE_CONFIG)
      --log-level=LEVEL      observability.logging.level (or
                             SEMAPHORE_LOG_LEVEL)
      --log-format=FORMAT    observability.logging.format (or
                             SEMAPHORE_LOG_FORMAT)
      --listen=ADDR          Address of the api listener (or SEMAPHORE_LISTEN)
      --ops-listen=ADDR      Address of the ops listener (or
                             SEMAPHORE_OPS_LISTEN)
      --manifest-key=KEY     controlPlane.manifest.key (or
                             SEMAPHORE_MANIFEST_KEY)
  -v, --version              Print the version and exit
  -h, --help                 Print this help and exit (wins over --version)
